@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
title 추정 근거 admission 경로

[호스트\n(identity, history, coverage)] as Host
[estimate-evidence.mjs\nEstimateEvidenceRuntime\n(인코딩/디코딩만)] as JS
[Rust 코어\nestimate_evidence::Session\n(레코드 1-64개, 퇴출 없음)] as Core
[네이티브 적합성 예제\n(같은 GFEE v1 어댑터)] as Native

Host --> JS : 생성 / 평가
JS --> Core : GFEE v1 패킷\n(kind 0 생성, kind 1 평가)
Native --> Core : GFEE v1 패킷
Core --> JS : Verdict 또는 Rejection
JS --> Host : snapshot (u64는 10진 문자열)
note right of Core
  선언된 basis만 admission:
  수치 추정, 명령,
  temporal 권한 없음
  (temporalAdmission: false)
end note
@enduml
